  "description": "The Shift R5 is constructed with materials drawn from 6000 series alloy. Its frame features an internal head tube and Haro's Four-Bar linkage frame design. This design includes a Trail suspension platform that promotes pedaling with a central linkage and chainstay pivots to optimize shock performance. The R5 uses RockShox' s new Recon Silver RS Boost suspension fork with 130mm of travel. Its Deore drive train pairs well with an FSA Comet Modular Boost crankset and its 30t Crmo chainring. The Shift R5 rolls along on Kenda Nevegal 27.5 x 2.35\" tires mounted to U28 TL tubeless compatible double wall rims and features a new Pivit internal dropper post for quick adjustments on the fly.\nShift R 6061-T6 alloy 4-Bar Linkage frame, 125mm rear travel, tapered head tube, 73mm BB shell, Boost, 12mm thru-axle dropouts\nRockShox Monarch R rear shock w/ rebound adjuster\nNew Rockshox Recon Silver RS 27.5\" Boost, 130mm travel\nFSA Comet Modular Boost crankset w/ 30T Crmo chainring\nNew Shimano Deore 6000 1x10 Shadow Plus rear derailleur\nNew Shimano Deore 6000 1x10 shifter & 11-42T cassette\nNew Pivit Internal Dropper Post, 31.6x100mm\nWeinmann U28 TL Tubeless compatible rims\nNew Pivit X6 alloy handlebar & stem",
